   <media:description>𝑻𝒉𝒆 𝑹𝒆𝒅 𝑳𝒊𝒏𝒆 𝒆𝒙𝒕𝒆𝒏𝒅𝒆𝒅 𝒗𝒆𝒓𝒔𝒊𝒐𝒏 𝒐𝒏 𝑨𝒑𝒑! https://www.ferrari.com/formula1/scuderia-ferrari-app?utm_source=instagram&amp;utm_medium=social&amp;utm_campaign=2026_ferrarihypercar_social

In endurance racing, not everything goes according to plan. And sometimes, the unexpected becomes part of the story.

At the 6 Hours of Fuji, Ferrari Hypercar faced a challenging race weekend, with unexpected twists and situations that put the team and its drivers to the test.

In this episode of The Red Line, go behind the scenes and discover how the Ferrari - AF Corse crews navigated the unforeseen challenges of racing at Fuji Speedway, where adapting to the unexpected is all part of the game.

#Ferrari499P #FerrariHypercar #WEC 

