   <media:description>Every dream begins with a little wonder.
For the Ferrari Holiday 2026 Campaign, an ordinary wardrobe opens the door to an extraordinary world, where imagination brings the symbols and creations of Ferrari to life.
Inspired by the magic of discovery and the dreams that stay with us from childhood, the campaign celebrates the joy of wishing and the excitement of making those wishes come true.

The Ferrari Holiday 2026 Gift Guide brings this spirit to life through a curated selection of creations reflecting different passions and personal connections to the Prancing Horse.

Discover more at store.ferrari.com and Ferrari boutiques worldwide.

#Ferrari #FerrariHoliday2026</media:description>
